<title>USA: Ky. Economic Development yields 5.75 pct in 2028.</title>
<headline>Ky. Economic Development yields 5.75 pct in 2028.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>JJB Hilliard, WL Lyons, Inc said it tentatively priced $45 million of Kentucky Economic Development Finance Authority, hospital revenue and refunding revenue bonds, series 1997, with a top yield of 5.75 percent in 2028.</p>
